error[hidden-input]: method reads `HiddenInputPositive.SCALE`, which other method writes
  --> src/HiddenInputPositive.jl:10:22
   |
 8 | set_scale!(scale::Float64) = (SCALE[] = scale; nothing)
   | ------------------------------------------------------- writes `HiddenInputPositive.SCALE`
 9 | 
10 | scaled(x::Float64) = SCALE[] * x
   |                      ^^^^^^^ reads `HiddenInputPositive.SCALE`
   |
   = why: result depends on state caller cannot see; caller that changes it affects every other caller
   = fix: pass state as argument   [manual]
   = docs: corset explain hidden-input
   = note: deny from correctness group, library preset
   = note: opt out with `# corset: allow hidden-input -- <reason>`

error[hidden-input]: method draws from default RNG
  --> src/HiddenInputPositive.jl:12:25
   |
12 | noisy(x::Float64) = x + randn()
   | ------------------------------- takes no RNG argument
   |                         ^^^^^^^ reads default RNG
   |
   = why: caller cannot seed draws or pass own RNG; concurrent tasks share stream
   = fix: take `rng::AbstractRNG` argument and pass it to each draw   [manual]
   = docs: corset explain hidden-input

